{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1212819-ideas-for-immaculate-grand-master-five-jade-gloves","id":1212819,"title":"Ideas for Immaculate Grand Master five-jade gloves","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-28T15:38:01-07:00","id":1212819,"title":"Ideas for Immaculate Grand Master five-jade gloves","content":"Not smashfists, but gloves that add no weapon traits to barehanded attacks.<br /> <br /> Gloves woven with cloth-of-jade in all five colors.<br /> <br /> The pinkie and knife-edge of the hands are woven with white jade. This enables an Evocation that allows the Grandmaster to perform smashing attacks with the ax-handle fist-smashing attacks of Earth Dragon, giving him access to Earth Dragon Charms which would otherwise require a tetsubo or hammer.<br /> <br /> The forefinger of the gloves might be green jade, for assisting the poking attacks of Wood Dragon. There's temptation for the thumbs to be green instead, but would you rather poke people to death with your thumbs just for a gardening pun?<br /> <br /> Either black jade or red jade should compose the middle finger, because Water is rude and Fire is inflammatory.<br /> <br /> Blue jade is either the ring finger or the thumb.<br /> <br /> I don't have other ideas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-28T16:40:29-07:00","id":1212835,"title":"","content":"So the point here is to develop sweet Evocations that combo well with the various Immaculate styles?<br /> <br /> ...wait, would it be kosher to have Evocations that have Martial Arts Charms as prerequisites? Even, say, multiple Charms from different styles? Because that could be <i>interesting</i>, although something about it feels vaguely inappropriate to me. (Does it screw with game balance if you could effectively expand MA Charm trees via Evocation in this way?)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T06:03:05-07:00","id":1213027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1212819-ideas-for-immaculate-grand-master-five-jade-gloves?p=1212835#post1212835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So the point here is to develop sweet Evocations that combo well with the various Immaculate styles?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes.<br /> <br /> The idea came to me when thinking about how Earth Dragon Style is now more dependent on having a weapon than it was before, and how a pair of non-weapon gloves would be kosher in a way that smashfists would not. They couldn't supply the Smashing keyword as a weapon, but they could do so through an Evocation.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> ...wait, would it be kosher to have Evocations that have Martial Arts Charms as prerequisites? </div> </div> </div>Robert Vance said yes.<br /> <br /> Evocations theoretically could serve as the missing link for Charms that use both native Charms and Martial Arts Charms as prerequisites.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Even, say, multiple Charms from different styles? </div> </div> </div>If the weapon's nature, the Styles, and the Evocations you want all have a reasonable connection, I suppose.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}